OL,3,ATwo accused of drug trafficking after
OL,4,AUK-Nigeria investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been charged
OL,7,Fwith international drugs trafficking
OL,8,Foffences as part of an investigation
OL,9,Finvolving police in the UK and Nigeria.
OL,11,FOladipupo Atandare, 50, from Dagenham
OL,12,Fand Latifat Yusuf, 44, from Hornchurch
OL,13,Fwere arrested following the seizure of
OL,14,Fmore than 180kg (397lb) of cocaine in
OL,15,Fthe UK on 5 August.
OL,17,FThey appeared at Barkingside
OL,18,FMagistrates Court on 8 August and were
OL,19,Fremanded in custody. They will next
OL,20,Fappear at Snaresbrook Crown Court on 7
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
