OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police said the
OL,7,Farrests related to solely the UK drugs
OL,8,Fseizure, but inquiries are continuing
OL,9,Finto the discovery of a similar-sized
OL,10,Famount of cocaine in Nigeria.
